OL,3,ATube strike ends but more dates set for
OL,4,ADecember
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first in a series of 24-hour
OL,7,Fstrikes on the London Underground has
OL,8,Fended, with more industrial action
OL,9,Fplanned for December, January and
OL,10,FFebruary.
OL,12,FTube drivers from the Rail, Maritime
OL,13,Fand Transport (RMT) union walked out at
OL,14,Fnoon on Thursday, with workers ending
OL,15,Ftheir action at noon on Friday.
OL,17,FThe strike action was the result of a
OL,18,Fdispute between the union and Transport
OL,19,Ffor London (TfL) over the changing
OL,20,Fterms and conditions attached to the
OL,21,Foption of a four or five day week.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
